  "description": "Microsoft.Playwright-backed IPageLoadTransport for WebReaper. Modern .NET-native browser SDK with multi-browser support (Chromium, Firefox, WebKit), auto-wait semantics, and full Network interception via page.RouteAsync. Replaces the deleted WebReaper.Puppeteer satellite (ADR-0009 named direction, actioned by ADR-0053). Adds ScraperEngineBuilder.WithPlaywrightPageLoader over the core WithLoadTransport registration seam. Satellite package (ADR-0009) — Microsoft.Playwright stays out of WebReaper core; core stays dependency-light and AOT-clean. For AOT scenarios, use WebReaper.Cdp instead.",
  "iconFile": "logo.png",
  "id": "WebReaper.Playwright",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-05-26T22:36:33.85Z",
